    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming end-of-terrace residence located in mature residential area on the edge of Fermoy town. Presented in very good condition throughout, this owner-occupier three bedroom property extends to c.1,150 sq. ft. over two floors and is ready for immediate occupation.  Rare opportunity to purchase a unique residence with all town amenities on your doorstep.  This property is sure to appeal to all sectors of the property market.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room\t\r\n4.84m x 2.96m\t\r\nTimber floor, open fire with solid fuel insert stove and stone surround, power points, T.V. point, radiator.\r\n\r\nKitchen\t\r\n5.41m x 3.14m\t\r\nTile effect floor, floor and eye level units, integrated oven/hob, tile splash-back, power points, access to sunroom.\r\n\r\nSunroom\r\n1.45m x 2.28m\t\r\nTile floor, radiator, power points, access to rear.\r\n\r\nUtility\t\r\n2.36m x 1.70m\t\r\nTile floor, power points, plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\r\n2.83m x 2.11m\t\r\nTile effect floor, floor to ceiling wall tiles,  W.H.B., W.C., wet room area with electric shower, radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n3.33m x 2.15m\t\r\nTimber floor, built-in wardrobe, radiator, power points.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n3.42m x 3.07m\t\r\nTimber floor, built-in wardrobe, power points, radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n5.29m x 3.24m\t\r\nTimber floor, slide-robe, power points, radiator.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\t\r\n2.36m x 1.13m\t\r\nTile floor, floor to ceiling wall tiles, W.H.B., W.C.\r\n\r\nHot-press with storage shelving.\r\n\r\nServices\t\r\nAll mains services. \r\nStanley range cooker for cooking and heating purposes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Excellent location within minutes walk of town centre.\r\n- Good quality finish throughout and ready for immediate occupation.\r\n- Generous living space extending to c.1,150 sq. ft.\r\n- Sash triple glazed windows to the front as well as new composite front door.\r\n- Large secluded rear garden with access from rear, patio area and garden shed. \r\n- Dual frontage to two public roads, \r\n- Stanley Range cooker for heating /cooking purposes - operated by oil.\r\n- Owner occupied, no rent restrictions applicable."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E"
      }
